  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is collinear with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is collinear with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>→</mo></mover></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p>Comparing both the sides,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p>Putting these values in equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Comparing this equation with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>→</mo></mover></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></math></p>"
